Description: dril: add sun60i-kms to the driver list
 Add sun60i-kms to the driver list in src/gallium/targets/dril/meson.build
 (link sun60i-kms_dri.so to dril_dri.so) and the entry point
 __driDriverGetExtensions_sun60i_kms to dril_target.c. AIGLX in the X server
 looks up this symbol; without it loading fails with "undefined symbol:
 __driDriverExtensions". It only has an effect with glamor (without glamor
